  "content": "<p><strong>快取</strong>&nbsp;(<strong>de_cache</strong>) 是一張在&nbsp;<em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcounterstrike.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fCounter-Strike%253a_Global_Offensive\" rel=\"nofollow\">《絕對武力：全球攻勢》</a></em>&nbsp;與&nbsp;<em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcounterstrike.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fCounter-Strike_2\" rel=\"nofollow\">《絕對武力2》</a></em>&nbsp;中可用的&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcounterstrike.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fBomb_Defusal\" rel=\"nofollow\">拆除炸彈</a>&nbsp;地圖。</p><p>該地圖背景設定於烏克蘭的普里皮亞季。從恐怖分子重生點可看見&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fChernobyl_Nuclear_Power_Plant\" rel=\"nofollow\">車諾比核電廠</a>&nbsp;，以及附近的建築物，甚至包括與真實世界對應的圍欄材料。</p>",
